<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Reports on DefinIT</title><link>https://www.definit.co.uk/tag/reports/</link><description>Recent content in Reports on DefinIT</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en</language><copyright>© 2026</copyright><lastBuildDate>Wed, 29 Jun 2016 22:42:40 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://www.definit.co.uk/tag/reports/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>#vROps Webinar 2016 – Part 6 : Understanding vROps SuperMetric &amp; Views</title><link>https://www.definit.co.uk/2016/06/vrops-webinar-2016-part-6-understanding-vrops-supermetric-views/</link><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jun 2016 22:42:40 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://www.definit.co.uk/2016/06/vrops-webinar-2016-part-6-understanding-vrops-supermetric-views/</guid><description>&lt;div&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="https://www.definit.co.uk/images/2016/01/CZFR4nKUsAADI5G.png"&gt;&lt;img class="alignright size-thumbnail wp-image-6827" src="https://www.definit.co.uk/images/2016/01/CZFR4nKUsAADI5G.png" alt="vROps webinar logo" width="150" height="150" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Sunny just completed the editing and upload of the the latest episode of the &lt;b&gt;vROps Webinar Series 2016&lt;/b&gt;. With this we have completed 6 sessions this year. I am glad that we are able to dish out sessions every month and the interest level in these sessions just keeps on growing. Looking forward to deliver more content for the rest of the year.&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;div&gt;&#10; &lt;span lang="EN-GB"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;div&gt;&#10; &lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span lang="EN-GB"&gt;Session Details:-&lt;span class="apple-converted-space"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span lang="EN-GB"&gt;In this episode, we talk about content within vROps. To begin with, we speak about Views and SuperMetrics. With this you will get a lot of insights into how you can use these features to build some useful, Reports and Dashboards within your vROps environments. &lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;div&gt;&#10; &lt;span lang="EN-GB"&gt;&lt;b&gt; &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;div&gt;&#10; &lt;span lang="EN-GB"&gt;Once again I would like to thank my friend and partner in this project&lt;span class="apple-converted-space"&gt; Sunny&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="apple-converted-space"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;as without him this would not be possible.&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;div&gt;&#10; &lt;span lang="EN-GB"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;div&gt;&#10; &lt;b&gt;&lt;span lang="EN-GB"&gt;So without further ado,&lt;span class="apple-converted-space"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;here is the recording for this session:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;div style="position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden;"&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;iframe allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share; fullscreen" loading="eager" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/khBMWhr2aFg?autoplay=0&amp;amp;controls=1&amp;amp;end=0&amp;amp;loop=0&amp;amp;mute=0&amp;amp;start=0" style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border:0;" title="YouTube video"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>